                        <p class="lp-repo-pkg-desc text-[var(--ex-color-nebula-muted)] fs-[var(--ex-font-size-xxxs)] fw-[var(--ex-para-font-weight)]">Accessible modal dialog — usable standalone or within Strata.</p>
